{"ID":"20240118151035-c93awka","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151035-c93awka","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151035-c93awka\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151035-7i31wsl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143831-3om9qng\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:77,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143749-fwngcoe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:88,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:88\u0026#125;","title":"261白垩262冬灰263青琅玕","type":"doc","updated":"20240202115545"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151035-7i31wsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151035-7i31wsl","updated":"20240122143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白垩"}]},{"ID":"20240122143715-lk151h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143715-lk151h5","updated":"20240122143721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，温，无毒。治女子寒热，症瘕，月闭，积聚，阴肿痛，漏下，无子。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143729-q0yxr2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143729-q0yxr2l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产河南山西，今他省亦多有之，画家用之，亦名画粉。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143732-yftpeyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143732-yftpeyo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143733-vto4zft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143733-vto4zft"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】白垩主燥湿温臓，治吐血反胃泻痢，外用治风赤烂眼，疿疹搔痒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143735-jqun8pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143735-jqun8pn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】阴肿痛瘘下无子，泻痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143736-m0b9jsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143736-m0b9jsb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】疗女子血结。涩肠，止痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143737-yztp8sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143737-yztp8sm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治鼻红血，痔瘘泄精，男子水藏冷，女子子宫冷。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143738-jjbvt42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143738-jjbvt42"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通数分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143740-0jqr5d4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143740-0jqr5d4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】用时宜取白色者，以盐汤飞过，以免结涩入肠，不可久服，否则损五脏，令人羸瘦。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143741-lgxbu18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143741-lgxbu18"}},{"ID":"20240122143749-fwngcoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143749-fwngcoe","updated":"20240202115545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"261，白垩。这个垩，就是白土。白色的土。过去呢这个画家丹青，用来做染料的。这个，味苦性温无毒。这个土类的东西可以燥湿，温燥。所以治疗吐血，灶心土，外用治疗风湿，瘙痒，皮疹都可以使用。哦，那，这种土类的东西呢。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143750-39cipa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143750-39cipa0","updated":"20240202115510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看【甄权】疗女子血结。涩肠，止痢。一般来说土来治疗水，所以河堤泛滥了，土可以做河堤。土能够止下痢，所以严重的下痢都可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143755-8ib1hgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143755-8ib1hgu"}},{"ID":"20240122143756-63bz3kd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143756-63bz3kd","updated":"20240122143802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"冬灰"}]},{"ID":"20240122143803-umo8jpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143803-umo8jpv","updated":"20240122143808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名藜灰。味辛，微温。治黑子，去疣息肉，疽蚀，疥瘙。生川泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143813-k2todfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143813-k2todfs","updated":"20240122143815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个262，冬灰。就是藜灰。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143821-kom5ixx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143821-kom5ixx"}},{"ID":"20240122143822-rgx0702","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143822-rgx0702","updated":"20240122143823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"青琅玕"}]},{"ID":"20240122143823-42qz850","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143823-42qz850","updated":"20240122143830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名石珠。味辛，平，无毒。治身痒，火疮，痈伤，白秃，疥瘙，死肌。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143831-3om9qng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143831-3om9qng","updated":"20240202115535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"263，青琅玕，石珠。现在几乎都没有使用了。本草经里面很多东西都没用到。"}]}]}